        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek 5052VR, Verve Knobset with Rectangular Rosette</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Verve Knob with Modern Rectangular Rose is the most awesome modern door knob that we have ever seen. Look at this knobset--its sleek and sophisticated design, its contemporary finish choices, and its uniqueness--and you will know, you've found your perfect knob match! The Verve Knobset with Rectangular Rosette will fit most standard pre-drill doors so you can be confident that it will fit when you receive it. Just make sure to select your correct door thickness and backset. Don't know what a those are, never fear, <a href=\"/pages/contact\">contact us</a> and our customer sales team located in the USA will walk you through the entire ordering process. The Modern Designer Verve Knob comes packaged as a complete set: 2 knobs, 2 rosettes, and the mounting hardware. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Modern Designer Verve Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Fits standard door cut outs (2-1/8\" pre-drilled doors).</li>\r\n<li>Knob is surface mounted (rosette screws to the door's face).</li>\r\n<li>Solid brass knob and trim rose.</li>\r\n<li>Sold as complete set.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Modern Verve Knob and Rectangular Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Height: 4\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-1/4 - 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-VR-specifications.pdf?v=1704262420\"><b>Emtek Verve Knob Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Functions:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> No door latch. Door knobs on both sides of the door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking. Latch operates from either side of door. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need privacy locking. Latch operates from either side. Push button on interior rose engages privacy; emergency release hole is on exterior rose. Turning inside knob will release privacy push button and retract the door latch. Package Includes: 2 knobs, 2 roses, privacy button, door latch, strike plate, dust box, faceplate, spindle, and mounting screws.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p align=\"center\">\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern7-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354499\" width=\"599\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Verve Knob with Modern Rectangular Rose",
                "description": "The Verve Knob with Modern Rectangular Rose is the most awesome modern door knob that we have ever seen. Look at this knobset--its sleek and sophisticated design, its contemporary finish choices, and its uniqueness--and you will know, you've found your perfect knob match! The Verve Knobset with Rectangular Rosette will fit most standard pre-drill doors so you can be confident that it will fit when you receive it. The Modern Designer Verve Knob comes packaged as a complete set: 2 knobs, 2 rosettes, and the mounting hardware. Choose from dummy, passage, and privacy functions.",
                "keywords": "Verve Knob with Modern Rectangular Roses, Emtek 5052VR, Emtek 5112VR, Emtek 5212VR, Modern Verve Knob with Rectangular Rosettes, Verve Knobset with Rectangular Rosettes, EMT-5052VR, Modern Designer Verve Knobs, Modern Verve Knob and Rectangular Roses, modern door knobs,"
